<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2">
  <Document>
    <name>Vivillon Pattern Distribution</name>
    <description>Add information through this form: https://forms.gle/UbwDKfUBNBW9X9qX9.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is the current best crowd-sourced version of the Vivillon pattern distribution for Pokemon Go. Colored areas are the current best estimates for each pattern. Black lines are known borders between regions, yellow lines are assumed/likely borders between regions, and red lines are complete unknowns.</description>
